{"code":"290720","name":"푸드나무","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 2013년 설립되어 식품 제조, 도소매, 유통, 전자상거래업 등을 영위하며 2018년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 종속회사로 ㈜에프엔프레시(식육판매 및 식자재 유통), 베트남·중국·미국 해외법인을 보유하고 있음. 동사는 B2C 전자상거래 플랫폼을 통해 다이어트 및 간편건강식품 유통과 생산(OEM)을 주요사업으로 하는 푸드테크 기업으로, '랭킹닭컴', '개근질마트', '피키다이어트' 등을 운영하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":1066.0,"open":1219.0,"high":1219.0,"low":1035.0,"volume":1665005,"amount":1774895330.0,"ret_1d":-11.9008,"gap":0.7438,"range_pct":17.2608,"ret_5":-19.9098,"ret_20":-64.2881,"ret_60":-66.3722,"ret_120":-67.8431,"ret_250":-50.6481,"ma20":2345.5,"ma60":2720.5,"ma120":2839.5,"ma200":2767.48,"close_vs_ma200":-61.4812,"close_vs_ma60":-60.816,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-90.9393,"r2_60":0.3344,"slope_120":-48.9249,"r2_120":0.1693,"slope_250":40.2254,"r2_250":0.1686,"high52":3980.0,"low52":1035.0,"pos_52w":1.0526,"dd_52w":-73.2161,"mdd_1y":-73.0127,"atr14_pct":40.4248,"vol_ann_60":113.301,"vol_avg20":5732804.4,"vol_ratio20":0.2904,"vr5":3.4625,"vr20":67.3003,"amount_avg5":7069186441.4,"amount_avg20":9048545549.55,"amount_avg60":3115581296.7667,"obv_chg20":54.4023,"turnover_20":300.5459,"pv_eff_20":-0.2139,"rsi14":21.7654,"frgn_net_5":-12945.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0339,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0339,"frgn_net_20":2249.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0059,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0059,"frgn_net_60":-23888.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0626,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0626,"frgn_net_120":-505767.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.3258,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.3258,"foreign_ratio":0.49,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.05,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":-36.0,"op_margin_q":-27.907,"op_qoq":48.5714,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-56.5217,"rev_yoy":-50.9506,"op_trend_4q":-27.1329,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-25.99,"debt_ratio":203.78,"per":null,"pbr"